## State Tables

Release-scoped. Every table has default, loading, empty, partial, error and disabled-with-reason, plus permission and live states where they apply. Words follow `microcopy.md`, the single source for every string; screens.md gives the message keys. Where a string here and microcopy.md ever differ, microcopy.md wins (validation 2026-10-28).


